OL,5,G0306 Outlook
OL,6,     FAfter Nemonte Nenquimo saw the
OL,7,     Fdestruction the oil industry was
OL,8,     Fbringing to the Amazon, she fought
OL,9,     Fback and won a landmark legal
OL,10,     Fvictory protecting 500,000 acres
OL,11,     Fof rainforest.
OL,12,G0350 Witness History
OL,13,     FIn 1945, as the British Fourteenth
OL,14,     FArmy fought the Japanese for the
OL,15,     Fcity of Mandalay, they were
OL,16,     Faccompanied by a BBC producer.
